  m_text: 'PHANTOMOLKA: Field Guide


    Your goal

    The house is full of ghosts. Find every one and capture it on camera to fill your Logbook. Each ghost you photograph is added to your Logbook. Find them all!


    Don''t Look Away!

    Some ghosts will use any opportunity they have to flee, look away for even an instant and they''re gone. '
